# The page template and the acceptance scripts are read by programs that reason in lines. A
# working copy in CRLF (Git for Windows's default) was enough to make reading the embedded
# data fail: so we freeze LF everywhere in the working copy, except where the tool demands
# CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
